It seems that object detection potions and gold and food detection scrolls are
almost useless.  Rather than showing a page of stuff and going away, detected
objects should stay on the regular map of the level, like magic detection in
old UltraRogue - I am truly dating myself :-).  Object detection now seems only
useful as fodder for water potions, and the scrolls are only similarly useful
for fodder to make blank ones.

